OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly cloudy but dry start
OL,6,Fto the day. Sunny spells at times
OL,7,Fthrough the morning but with isolated
OL,8,Fshowers from the late morning onwards.
OL,9,FFresh winds developing but feeling
OL,10,Fpleasant in the sun.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAny lingering showers ease to
OL,13,Fleave a dry, partly cloudy evening.
OL,14,FRemaining partly cloudy with clear
OL,15,Fspells overnight and dry for most
OL,16,Fareas. Feeling cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
