OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FPartly cloudy and dry to
OL,6,Fstart but with good sunny spells.
OL,7,FIsolated showers may develop but
OL,8,Fremaining dry for most areas. Feeling
OL,9,Fcooler in fresh winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FPatchy
OL,12,Frain across the area for a time on
OL,13,FWednesday but clearing to a fine and
OL,14,Fdry Thursday. More unsettled on Friday
OL,15,Fwith rain and then showers. Fresh
OL,16,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
